Authors’ contributions
Nan Lin analyzed and interpreted the data, wrote the original manuscript. Lin 
Bai acquired and analyzed the data. Qiang Lu conceived the study, revised the 
manuscript. Qing Liu and Jianhua Chen diagnosed the patients and analyzed 
EEG data. Haitao Ren performed and analyzed the GAD antibody tests. Hong-
zhi Guan acquired the data and diagnosed the patients. All authors read and 
approved the final manuscript. All authors agree to be accountable for the 
content of the work.
